{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/DateTime\/weekNumberingYear"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:4GLib16DateTimeProtocolPAAE17weekNumberingYearSivp::SYNTHESIZED::s:4GLib8DateTimeC","title":"weekNumberingYear","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"extendedModule":"GLib","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"weekNumberingYear"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/DateTime","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/DateTime\/DateTimeProtocol-Implementations"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/datetime\/weeknumberingyear"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the ISO 8601 week-numbering year in which the week containing"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"datetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" falls."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"weekNumberingYear","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This function, taken together with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_date_time_get_week_of_year()"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_date_time_get_day_of_week()"},{"text":" can be used to determine the full ISO","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"week date on which ","type":"text"},{"code":"datetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is usually equal to the normal Gregorian year (as returned by"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"g_date_time_get_year()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), except as detailed below:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For Thursday, the week-numbering year is always equal to the usual","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calendar year.  For other days, the number is such that every day"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"within a complete week (Monday to Sunday) is contained within the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same week-numbering year."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For Monday, Tuesday and Wednesday occurring near the end of the year,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this may mean that the week-numbering year is one greater than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calendar year (so that these days have the same week-numbering year"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as the Thursday occurring early in the next year).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For Friday, Saturday and Sunday occurring near the start of the year,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this may mean that the week-numbering year is one less than the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calendar year (so that these days have the same week-numbering year","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as the Thursday occurring late in the previous year).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An equivalent description is that the week-numbering year is equal to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the calendar year containing the majority of the days in the current","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"week (Monday to Sunday)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that January 1 0001 in the proleptic Gregorian calendar is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Monday, so this function never returns 0."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/DateTime":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DateTime"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DateTime","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GDateTime"},{"type":"text","text":" is a structure that combines a Gregorian date and time"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"into a single structure."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"DateTime","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/DateTime","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/datetime"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/DateTime/DateTimeProtocol-Implementations":{"type":"topic","title":"DateTimeProtocol Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/datetime\/datetimeprotocol-implementations","kind":"article","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/DateTime\/DateTimeProtocol-Implementations","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","title":"GLib","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glib","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/DateTime/weekNumberingYear":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/DateTime\/weekNumberingYear","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"weekNumberingYear"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"title":"weekNumberingYear","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/datetime\/weeknumberingyear","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the ISO 8601 week-numbering year in which the week containing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"datetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" falls."}]}}}